  "headline": "Syria's Foreign Ministry condemns Houthi drone attack on Medina power station",
  "pages": [
    {
      "text": "Syria’s Foreign Ministry issued a condemnation on Friday regarding a Houthi drone attack on a power distribution station located in Medina, Saudi Arabia. According to the North Press Agency, the ministry stated that the strike targeted civilian infrastructure, specifically a station that supplies electricity to the Prophet’s Mosque. The ministry further asserted that the attack violated Saudi Arabia’s sovereignty and threatened regional stability."
    }
  ]
