  "pages": [
    {
      "text": "The Lebanese Army reported on Thursday that it seized approximately 245 kilograms of TNT, four explosive devices, eight detonators, and electrical wires used for detonating explosives. According to a statement from the army, the materials were being smuggled from Syria into Lebanon during monitoring operations conducted along the country's northern and eastern borders. The army stated that smugglers fled toward Syrian territory after an army patrol arrived at the site. The Lebanese Army conducts regular surveillance and security operations along its borders with Syria to monitor smuggling activities and prevent the movement of weapons and explosives."
    }
  ]
}

